<title>UK: Capital One prices $100 mln 30-year callable FRN.</title>
<headline>Capital One prices $100 mln 30-year callable FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been priced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAPITAL ONE</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *01.FEB.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +155 BP   PAY DATE   L31.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  98.425    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    98.425    FULL FEES   1.0</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE AT PAR AFTER 10-YEARS</p>
<p>		TO YIELD LIBOR +170 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
